     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-size:medium;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;text-indent:14px\"> Dear Dr.Yu,</span><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.15pt;font-size:medium;text-indent:10.8pt\"> I have associated phylogenetic tree with different type of plot. As the picture shows blew.</span></p></div><div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/57e920f959c70/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_20200325133559.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"微信截图_20200325133559.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"198\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\">I</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);letter-spacing:0.15pt\">n panel “Genome Size”, I consider to truncate the highest bar </span><span style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\">in the plot. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Could you help me solve the problem in ggtree?</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Thank you so much</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:medium;text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,3